      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The city’s origins trace back to a 1958 land purchase of 82,000 acres in the Mojave Desert, intended to be built all at once.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        16,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
